pre_install() {
    cat <<EOF

-----------------------------------------------------------------
-----------------------------------------------------------------

WARNING:

mailctl is deprecated in favor of oama from the same author.
oama's home page:

  https://github.com/pdobsan/oama

Please, remove mailctl-bin and install oama-bin instead:

  https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/oama-bin

-----------------------------------------------------------------
-----------------------------------------------------------------

EOF

}
